      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town once thrived as a lemon industry hub, birthing the Bonnie Brae Lemon variety from the first lemon ranch in 1871.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
