      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sweetwater Dam’s 1888 construction created Sweetwater Reservoir, but the 1906 flood from the dam’s failure submerged the Lower Sweetwater Valley.",
